              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle gaareeni duri qotani sagale irati oobratani mukha qoraatitiifi mogore baafti nami deebie achi imbahu. Gaareeni sunini oolmuma loonitifi ta ree ch'alla taati.",
          "type": "text",
